 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting (10)': There Is Good In Him / I Can Save Him, Endor: Chief Chirpa's Hut, Luke Skywalker, Jedi Knight, Luke's Lightsaber, Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay), I Feel The Conflict, Heading For The Medical Frigate (posted 'HFTMF'), Do, Or Do Not & Wise Advice, Insurrection and Staging Areas; these count toward the 60. Several Effects start, none named as the starting Effect, so no starting Effect is set.",
  "Posted 'Staging Areas (start Squadron Assignments vs. space)': Staging Areas is the starting card; the poster starts Squadron Assignments (listed under Effects) instead against space decks.",
  "Posted 'Leia with Blaster Pistol' dested Leia With Blaster Rifle (no Leia With Blaster Pistol card exists), as in 14898. 'Kiffix' dested the Light Kiffex (Jabba's Palace); 'R2-D2' R2-D2 (Artoo-Detoo); 'Millenium Falcon' Millennium Falcon; 'Intruder Missle' Intruder Missile; 'Yoda's Gimmer Stick' Yoda's Gimer Stick; 'Punch It' Punch It!.",
  "Posted section count 'Starships (3)' (Spiral, Millennium Falcon x2); the full list totals 60 as posted.",
  "An earlier version of the same author's TIGIH deck 14898 ('TIGIH Mains', 30 March 2001); not a repost: this list has Captain Han Solo x2, Millennium Falcon x2, Leia x2, Punch It! x2 and Intruder Missile x2, and no General Solo or I Don't Need Their Scum, Either.",
  "Credited to the existing page Evan Walker (same name and DeckTech handle EvO)."
